### Reproducibility

All analysis code is available in the project repository. To reproduce this analysis:

```bash
# 1. Clone the repository
git clone [repository-url]

# 2. Install dependencies
Rscript -e "install.packages(c('tidyverse', 'lubridate', 'here', 'gt', 'patchwork'))"

# 3. Run analysis scripts
Rscript scripts/01_data_loading.R
Rscript scripts/02_data_cleaning.R
Rscript scripts/03_eda.R
Rscript scripts/04_visualizations.R

# 4. Render report
quarto render index.qmd
```

